# CODEOWNERS
# GitHub behavior: when a PR touches matched files, GitHub automatically
# requests a review from the listed owner(s).
# Place this file in the root, /docs, or /.github of your repo.

# ── Global fallback — owns everything not matched below ───────────────────────
*                           @yourusername

# ── Lesson files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/lessons/                   @yourusername @co-author

# ── CI/CD workflows ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/workflows/         @yourusername

# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md                        @yourusername
CHANGELOG.md                @yourusername
CONTRIBUTING.md             @yourusername

# ── File samples ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/file-samples/              @yourusername

# ── Multiple owners (any one of them can approve) ─────────────────────────────
/docs/                      @yourusername @docs-team
